@SkyRoute_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133

### Search flights
POST {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/api/flights/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originAirport": "EZE",
  "destinationAirport": "GRU",
  "departureDate": "2026-06-15",
  "cabinClass": "Economy",
  "passengers": 1
}
###

