### Book a flight
POST {{SkyRoute_HostAddress}}/booking
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "BudgetWings",
  "flightNumber": "BW101",
  "passengers": [
    {
      "fullName": "john",
      "email": "john@doe.com",
      "documentType": "Passport",
      "documentNumber": "123841823"
    }
  ]
}

